│   Ctrl+W p, Ctrl+PageUp        Previous open request tab                                                   │
│   Ctrl+W P                     Pin or unpin the current tab (pinned tabs stay first)                       │
│   Ctrl+W F                     Add or remove the request from the favorites                                │
